From f5f930be85aa9faef0197d5b2b1967026e58a5c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aaron <aahladky@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 17:39:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] moe-cache: add --modelctl-capabilities probe and cache
 skeleton

- Add --modelctl-capabilities CLI flag that outputs JSON describing
  backend features, available devices, and cache flag names
- Add moe-cache.hpp/cpp: persistent SYCL slot pool for routed expert
  weights with LRU eviction, per-layer index, and atomic stats
- Integrate cache member into ggml_backend_sycl_context
- Add GGML_MOE_EXPERT_CACHE compile definition to ggml-sycl CMake
- Cache supports: init, lookup, record_miss, promote, stats_json

Sub-features still disabled: sycl hit path, hybrid CPU miss, metrics
endpoint, prefill policy, mmap advice, prefetch.
