Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

F1: Slot geometry — lazy_init now sets up_bytes/down_bytes = expert_bytes
    (was 0), so all three projections can be cached. Slot bytes = 3x expert.

F2: Async promotion — removed .wait() from promote_projection. Copy is
    submitted async; GPU serializes it before compute on same queue.

F3: Fused path gating — skip fused single-token path when cache is
    enabled, so the normal loop can consult cache per expert on decode.

F4: Policy/admission wiring — added g_moe_cache_policy global, wired
    from CLI through server.cpp. lazy_init now reads policy and admission
    from globals instead of hardcoding.

F5: Phase detection — server update_slots() calls moe_cache_set_phase_all
    based on whether any slot is still processing prompt tokens.

Hygiene: OOB bounds check in promote_projection, admission default 2
    (was 1), modelctl emits --moe-cache-bytes (not --moe-cache-device),
    no --moe-cache-miss-execution or --load-mode flags.
